      "description": "Workspace panel with a KPI row; the recommended value takes the gold edge and diamond.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\"><h2>Funding Twin</h2><div class=\"ds-kpis\"><div class=\"ds-kpi ds-accent\"><small>Best mix</small><b><button class=\"ds-gx\">60% debt</button></b></div><div class=\"ds-kpi\"><small>Founder value</small><b>Rs 41.2 cr</b></div></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E2DED5;border-radius:6px;padding:20px;display:grid;gap:14px;font-family:'Hanken Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif;color:#16171A}.ds-panel h2{margin:0;font-size:18px;font-weight:600}.ds-kpis{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}.ds-kpi{background:#F7F6F3;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:6px;padding:14px 16px;display:grid;gap:3px}.ds-kpi small{font-size:13px;color:#6A665D}.ds-kpi b{font-size:22px;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums lining-nums}.ds-accent{border-color:#C9A04F;box-shadow:inset 0 2px 0 #C9A04F}.ds-accent b::before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:9px;height:9px;background:#C9A04F;transform:rotate(45deg);margin-right:10px;vertical-align:3px}.ds-gx{font:inherit;color:inherit;background:none;border:0;padding:0 1px;cursor:pointer;border-bottom:1px dashed #7B5C1F;transition:background .15s}.ds-gx:hover{background:rgba(176,132,51,.12)}.ds-gx:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #C9A04F;outline-offset:3px}"
