      "html": "<div class=\"ds-dec\"><p>Kalyan Polymers, Rs 12 cr: best mix <b>60% debt / 40% equity</b></p><div class=\"ds-split\"><i style=\"flex-basis:60%;background:#5C88C4\"></i><i style=\"flex-basis:40%;background:#C9A04F\"></i></div><div class=\"ds-leg\"><span><i style=\"background:#5C88C4\"></i>Debt <b>60%</b></span><span><i style=\"background:#C9A04F\"></i>Equity <b>40%</b></span></div><span class=\"ds-sample\">Sample company, fictional data</span></div>",
